From 80c40d385574f74528b0d326b94ed1bf8b5fcdc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:35:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): confirm before archiving a chat with linked
 tasks or machines [daveey]

Archiving only hides a chat; its open Kanban tasks and rented machines keep
running out of sight. archiveSession now collects linked work and asks first:
core reports the row's kanban_active/kanban_blocked counts, and plugins add
their own lines via the new ctx.registerArchiveGuard (capped at 2.5 s, skipped
on error, so a guard can never block archiving). Covers every archive door
(row menu, hover button, tile menu, hotkey) since they all route through
archiveSession. skipLinkedConfirm opts out.
